[ilil F1/F2/F3 hypothesis]
  Keys: 0xF11301(F1/0x1301), 0xF11501(F1/0x1501), 0xF21501(F2/0x1501), 0xF31501(F3/0x1501), 0xF11520/21
  Low 0x1501 reused across F1/F2/F3 -> high byte selects table, low=offset inside decrypted heap
  To map low->string: read heap at (table_base + low*stride) after full loop, decode as UTF string
  This static replay gives heap layout; final string = heap[table_base + low] -> strlen -> UTF

[note] Best-effort static replay — lane semantics (cmhi 128-bit) are approximated.
